    <briefdescription>
<para>Move a particle and keep it in a box. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The transformation of a rigid body is moved in a ball of given size. The probability distribution is uniform over the ball. <simplesect kind="see"><para>MonteCarlo </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
